{"unit_id":"yinque91__dsh-mood#card-zh","repo":"yinque91/dsh-mood","commit":"aeb51617284fc7078cfecd5b4b7d70966120d64f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mood 是一个为 DeepSeek Harness 增加情绪状态反馈的插件。它监听用户消息中的中英文褒贬关键词，调整本机保存的积极性分数，并在每轮把状态提示加入 system prompt；分数低于阈值时，还会通过工具守卫拒绝普通工具调用。用户可以查看当前分数和近期事件、测试文本评分，或手动调整积极性。分数会随时间回到设定基线，插件也支持关闭状态提示和日志播报。适合想观察并改变助手回应主动程度的 DSH 用户；情绪判断基于关键词匹配，不需要额外 API 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:73-94","index.js:115-120","index.js:180-218","index.js:223-305"]}
{"unit_id":"yinque91__dsh-mood#card-en","repo":"yinque91/dsh-mood","commit":"aeb51617284fc7078cfecd5b4b7d70966120d64f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mood scores praise and criticism keywords, stores a local mood value, and adds a status prompt each turn. At low scores it blocks ordinary tool calls. Users can inspect events, test text, or adjust the score; it drifts back to baseline. It uses keyword matching and needs no external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:73-94","index.js:115-120","index.js:180-218","index.js:223-305"]}
